    "text": "Kait 8\nwebsite\nBatesville\nARDOT to host ribbon-cutting for Myers Street improvements in Batesville\nBy K8 Newsdesk,\n2 hours agoBATESVILLE, Ark. (KAIT) - The Arkansas Department of Transportation invites the public to attend a ribbon-cutting ceremony to celebrate the completion of the Myers Street improvements in Batesville. The ceremony will be at 11 a.m. Thursday, Sept. 11, at the Batesville Community Center Southeast Parking Lot, 1420 20th Street. According...",
